# InstallerHere is a complete, standard **`.gitignore`** file tailored for Python, Jupyter Notebooks, Streamlit, and Data Science projects. 

This ensures that temporary execution files, cache folders, virtual environments, and large dataset outputs are not uploaded to your GitHub repository.

---

### `.gitignore`

```text
# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# Virtual Environments
venv/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/
.venv/

# Jupyter Notebook Checkpoints & Cache
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/*

# Streamlit Cache & Settings
.streamlit/

# IDE / Editor settings
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Operating System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Large Data files / Local outputs (Optional)
*.log
*.sqlite3
